| `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` | Assembles references and Unreleased from independent entries; `--check` rejects stale outputs. | `make check-fragments`; `make assemble-fragments` | [`reference_fragments`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Preserves the output's stamp; rejects malformed, misnamed or duplicate entries and missing or unregistered folders. Not a date writer: `scripts/jobs/restamp_docs.py` stamps the assembled document. | [README.md](README.md) | always |
